## Non-Competition (Where Enforceable)

### Scope

| Element | Standard |
|---------|----------|
| Duration | 12 months post-employment |
| Geographic | US + countries of assignment |
| Industry | Healthcare IT/coordination |
| Activities | Competing business |

### Enforceability

| Jurisdiction | Status |
|--------------|--------|
| California | Not enforceable |
| Most US States | Generally enforceable |
| UK | Enforceable if reasonable |
| Singapore | Enforceable if reasonable |

### California Employees

Non-compete provisions NOT applicable in California per Business & Professions Code Section 16600.

