## Termination

### Termination by Company

| Type | Notice | Severance |
|------|--------|-----------|
| For Cause | Immediate | None |
| Without Cause | 2 weeks | Per policy |
| Layoff/RIF | Per WARN | Per policy |

### Termination by Employee

| Requirement | Standard |
|-------------|----------|
| Notice | 2 weeks (requested) |
| Transition | Cooperation required |
| Exit Interview | Required |

### Cause Definition

Cause includes:
- Willful misconduct
- Gross negligence
- Material breach
- Fraud or dishonesty
- Criminal conduct
- Violation of policy

### Severance (Standard)

| Tenure | Severance |
|--------|-----------|
| < 1 year | 2 weeks |
| 1-3 years | 4 weeks |
| 3-5 years | 8 weeks |
| 5+ years | 12 weeks |

